{"version":1,"key":"card:525","content":{"id":525,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"思维导图布局实现，如下"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_53be9308-8054-404b-aec5-e998ed49d14a.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_53be9308-8054-404b-aec5-e998ed49d14a.png","width":530.3779899578421},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"简单考虑，只考虑向右展开的布局。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"已经条件，知道根节点的位置 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"(\\text{rootX}, \\text{rootY})","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(rootX, rootY)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，以及所有节点的大小（宽高），求其他节点的位置 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"(x, y)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(x, y)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先看子节点的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"x","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和父节点 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\text{parentX}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"parentX"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的关系，非常简单，子节点在父节点右侧的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\text{marginX}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"MARGIN_X"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 处，即"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\text{childX} = \\text{parentX} + \\text{parentWidth} + \\text{marginX}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于子节点的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"y","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的计算就比较复杂了，考虑下图"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E5%AF%BC%E5%9B%BE_7e5d1ca0-d7fa-4440-8f59-632e6de9f689.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E5%AF%BC%E5%9B%BE_7e5d1ca0-d7fa-4440-8f59-632e6de9f689.png","width":618},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在知道父元素的位置和宽高的情况下以及所有子节点总体高度的情况下，计算所有子节点整体的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"y","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"y","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方向上要满足一个关系，就是"},{"type":"formatted","text":"父节点和子节点整体是居中对齐的","color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即满足"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\text{parentY} + \\dfrac{\\text{parentHeight}}{2} = \\text{childrenY} + \\frac{\\text{childrenHeight}}{2}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以得到"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\text{childrenY} = \\text{parentY} + \\dfrac{\\text{parentHeight}}{2} - \\frac{\\text{childrenHeight}}{2}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在知道总体的一个位置之后，计算单个子节点的位置就很简单了，比如对于第 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"i","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"i"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个子节点，它离顶部的距离就是之前所有节点的实际高度加上所有间距"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\text{child[i].childrenTop} = \\sum_{\\text{index} = 0}^{i - 1}\\text{child[index].actualHeight} + (i - 1) \\times \\text{marginY} ","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是这里还需要做一个调整，这里计算的是这个节点占据区域的整体位置，有可能这个节点的高度小于占据的高度，我们还需要将这个节点居中"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\text{child.top = child.childrenTop} + \\frac{\\text{child.actualHeight - child.height}}{2}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们假设 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\text{childrenHeight}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"childrenHeight"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是已知的，但实际上是需要计算的，当然很好算，就是所有子节点的占据的高度之和加上所有的间距，注意，这里占据的高度和节点的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\text{height}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"height"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 值并不相等，一个节点占据的高度("},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\text{actualHeight}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"actualHeight"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":")的计算方法是"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\text{node.actualHeight} = \\max(\\text{node.height}, \\text{node.childrenHeight}))","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所有 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\text{childrenHeight}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"childrenHeight "}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的计算为"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\text{node.childrenHeight} = \\sum_{i}^{n}\\text{children[i].actualHeight} + (n - 1) \\times \\text{marginY}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要两次遍历，第一次遍历计算 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"x","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\text{childrenHeight}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"childrenHeight"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\text{actualHeight}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"actualHeight"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，第二次遍历计算 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"y","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以参考以下代码"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const MARGIN_X = 36;\nconst MARGIN_Y = 16;\n\nconst dfs = (node: MindNodeElement, {\n    before,\n    after,\n  }, parent: MindNodeElement | null = null, index = 0) => {\n    before?.(node, parent, index);\n    node.children.forEach((child, index) => {\n      this.dfs(child, {\n        before,\n        after,\n      }, node, index);\n    });\n    after?.(node, parent, index);\n  }\n\nconst layout = (node: MindNodeElement): MindNodeElement => {\n  this.dfs(draft, {\n    before: (node, parent) => {\n      if (parent) {\n        node.x = parent.x + parent.width + MARGIN_X;\n      }\n    },\n    after: (node) => {\n      if (node.children.length > 0) {\n        node.childrenHeight = node.children.reduce((pre, cur) => {\n          return pre + cur.actualHeight;\n        }, 0) + (node.children.length - 1) * MARGIN_Y;\n        node.actualHeight = Math.max(node.childrenHeight, node.height);\n      } else {\n        node.actualHeight = node.height;\n        node.childrenHeight = 0;\n      }\n    }\n  })\n\n  this.dfs(draft, {\n    before: (node, parent, index) => {\n      if (!parent) return;\n\n      const baseY = parent.y + parent.height / 2 - parent.childrenHeight / 2;\n      const beforeSiblings = index > 0 ? parent.children.slice(0, index) : [];\n      const siblingsHeight = beforeSiblings.reduce((pre, cur) => {\n        return pre + cur.actualHeight;\n      }, 0) + beforeSiblings.length * MARGIN_Y;\n\n      const childrenTop = baseY + siblingsHeight;\n      node.y = childrenTop + (node.actualHeight - node.height) / 2;\n    }\n  })\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"b3e2046e-0823-48f9-ac23-59ca9eab4573","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"file-attachment","uuid":"6cedfb53-ded0-444e-b06a-378403dd247c","filePath":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E5%AF%BC%E5%9B%BE_462b476f-f3e7-4ca8-af8e-975e8640882d.drawio","fileName":"思维导图.drawio","isLocal":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["算法"],"createTime":1740350218720,"updateTime":1764293036040,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1764293036040}}